msgctxt "239\t356"
msgid "Kiryu, you dirty son of a bitch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "361\t438"
msgid "You're not gettin' away with this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704\t816"
msgid "The hell's the stoneface for? Huh, Mine!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "831\t971"
msgid "Don't just sit there twiddlin' your thumbs!\\nSay something, jackoff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "981\t1148"
msgid "Aniki. This is my office.\\nI suggest you be a little more respectful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1149\t1196"
msgid "You can shove your respect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1197\t1348"
msgid ""
"If you weren't so damn chill about everythin',\\nI'd never have got my ass "
"whooped by Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1349\t1510"
msgid ""
"I told you in the officers meeting.\\nI don't consider Kiryu-san my enemy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1517\t1649"
msgid "This wouldn't have happened had you\\nnot gone looking for a fight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1671\t1860"
msgid ""
"Now I'm gettin' lectured by some limp-dicked\\ncoward, huh!? Well I don't "
"wanna hear it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2510\t2666"
msgid "Ya hear, Mine!?\\nGimme your cash and your boys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2705\t2811"
msgid "Kiryu ain't survivin' the night!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2814\t3031"
msgid ""
"And then I'm gonna be seventh chairman!\\nI'll even let ya be my captain!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3058\t3157"
msgid "You truly are a fool, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3154\t3273"
msgid "The shit? I dare ya to say that again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3274\t3436"
msgid "The collection you just demolished...\\nwas worth over one billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3437\t3508"
msgid "Like I give a rat's ass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3509\t3600"
msgid "You wipe your shitstains with that kinda cash!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3601\t3665"
msgid "Money isn't the issue here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3674\t3782"
msgid "You just can't seem to perceive worth.\\nNeither theirs nor yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3792\t3857"
msgid "What was that!?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "3853\t3957"
msgid "Perceive this, you little shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4073\t4179"
msgid "I realize I failed to mention this before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4181\t4332"
msgid "But the truth is, I'm much stronger than I look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4821\t4909"
msgid "Mine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4912\t4989"
msgid "You're useless to me now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4993\t5132"
msgid "Except perhaps as my apology to Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5495\t5630"
msgid "Don't do it here.\\nHe's made a big enough mess as is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5631\t5691"
msgid "Yes, sir."
msgstr "Sì, signore."

msgctxt "5791\t5946"
msgid "Hey, hold on a sec... Mine!\\nWait, Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5946\t6016"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr ""
